+/// The scripted player's script. `jink` is the original (its nominal-frame pattern stretches ∝rtf in game time, and a
+/// ∝rtf-longer burn from low orbit ends in the planet, so the jink player is dead past a few game-hours at high rtf —
+/// the cliff of run 20261009-2120). `hold` and `coast` are depth-matched: a function of game time, so the same player
+/// behaviour at any horizon.
+#[derive(Clone, Copy, PartialEq)]
+enum Script { Jink, Hold, Coast }
+
 
